{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00342","headline":"幸秦川上梓潼山 · 後主衍","name":"幸秦川上梓潼山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乔岩簇冷烟，幽径上寒天。\n下瞰峨眉岭，上窥华岳巅。\n驱驰非取乐，按幸爲忧边。\n此去如登陟，歌楼路几千。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主衍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}